{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10444","headline":"送杨山人归嵩阳 · 高适","name":"送杨山人归嵩阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不到嵩阳动十年，旧时心事已徒然。\n一二故人不复见，三十六峰犹眼前。\n夷门二月柳条色，流莺数声泪沾臆。\n凿井耕田不我招，知君以此忘帝力。\n山人好去嵩阳路，惟余眷眷长相忆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10444.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10444","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}